      "text": "The observer sees yellow, orange and green, but lacks red and blue. Real ECDHE uses\nmathematics and temporary private inputs, not paint.",
      "originalText": "The observer sees yellow, orange and green, but lacks red and blue. Real ECDHE uses\nmathematics and temporary private inputs, not paint.",
