      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TLS 1.2: STATIC RSA\nClient makes a starting secret and\nencrypts it with the server's RSA public\nkey.\n\nLater: stolen server.key opens that\nrecorded secret. Data keys can be\nreconstructed.",
      "originalText": "TLS 1.2: STATIC RSA\nClient makes a starting secret and\nencrypts it with the server's RSA public\nkey.\n\nLater: stolen server.key opens that\nrecorded secret. Data keys can be\nreconstructed.",
