      "locked": false,
      "text": "OUR TLS 1.3 EXCHANGE\nTemporary private inputs establish\nsecrets separately from the RSA\nidentity key.\n\nLater: server.key alone cannot recreate\npast traffic keys from the recording.",
      "originalText": "OUR TLS 1.3 EXCHANGE\nTemporary private inputs establish\nsecrets separately from the RSA\nidentity key.\n\nLater: server.key alone cannot recreate\npast traffic keys from the recording.",
