      "text": "Our forced old suite: TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_128_GCM_SHA256 (0x009c). RSA wraps\nthe starting secret. AES-GCM protects the HTTP data. TLS 1.2 with ECDHE can\nprovide forward secrecy.",
      "originalText": "Our forced old suite: TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_128_GCM_SHA256 (0x009c). RSA wraps\nthe starting secret. AES-GCM protects the HTTP data. TLS 1.2 with ECDHE can\nprovide forward secrecy.",
