      "text": "1 CLIENT CHECKS SERVER\nServer has an Ed25519 host key. The\nreal public key is preloaded in\nknown_hosts.\nStrictHostKeyChecking=yes requires\nthat identity.",
      "originalText": "1 CLIENT CHECKS SERVER\nServer has an Ed25519 host key. The\nreal public key is preloaded in\nknown_hosts.\nStrictHostKeyChecking=yes requires\nthat identity.",
